# Local/private live evidence. These files may contain real trip parameters,
# provider URLs, screenshots, runtime identifiers, or large raw traces. Keep
# only deliberately redacted synthetic/public summaries in Git.
/benchmarks/results/live-*
/benchmarks/results/model-runtime-smoke-*
/benchmarks/results/model-explanation-smoke-*
/benchmarks/results/browser-companion-*
/benchmarks/results/icom-live-*
