/benchmarks/results/ui-e2e-*
# Deterministic scenario contracts and compact LoRA summaries remain public;
# only their raw provider executions and screenshots stay local.

# Real browser/provider captures are local-only. They may contain session
# headers, personal trip parameters, third-party page payloads, or screenshots.
/evidence/live-runs/
/docs/case-studies/

